        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions BGH100CRVSS4, Curved Bighorn Stainless Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis incredible contemporary curved stainless steel door pull can be used in many applications such as entry doors, patio doors, store doors as well as on appliances such as refrigerators and freezers. The Curved Stainless Steel Door Pull is available in Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes in 12 inches, 24 inches, or 36 inches long. The Bighorn Door Handle is available for thru-bolt mounting or surface mounting. Want back-to-back mounting? no problem, just <a href=\"/products/curved-stainless-steel-door-pulls-pair-first-impressions-pr-bgh100crvss4\">Click Here</a> to order a pair back-to-back mounted.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Bighorn 100 Series Stainless Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finishes:<b>Polished Stainless Steel</b> or <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel Tubing</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-BGH100CRVSS4-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262228\"><b>First Impressions BGH100CRVSS4 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BGH100012CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100024CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BGH100036CRVSS4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This curved stainless steel door pull is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Requires 2 pulls.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Curved Bighorn Stainless Steel Door Pull",
                "description": "This incredible contemporary curved stainless steel door pull can be used in many applications such as entry doors, patio doors, store doors as well as on appliances such as refrigerators and freezers. The Curved Stainless Steel Door Pull is available in Polished Stainless Steel or Satin Stainless Steel finishes in 12 inches, 24 inches, 36 inches, or 48 inches long. The Bighorn Door Handle is available for thru-bolt mounting or surface mounting.",
